{"id":"memorial_105102","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial105100","label":"Call Logs · Looking for the Giant.txt"},"label":"51002.txt","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_105101","next":"memorial_105103","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_105102_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_02_description","text":"This time, there are handprints."},{"id":"memorial_105102_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_02_description","text":"Definitely human."},{"id":"memorial_105102_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_02_description","text":"Maybe someone touched this wall with muddy hands. The outer walls are covered in them."},{"id":"memorial_105102_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_02_description","text":"Was it just one giant, or a group moving together?"},{"id":"memorial_105102_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_02_description","text":"I can't be sure, but this could be a huge discovery."},{"id":"memorial_105102_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_02_description","text":"Hopefully, it'll get me promoted."}]}